esponsibility, but moody and loner (crew cooperation). Argue that B's interpersonal issues are less severe than D's moody/loner which could affect long flights.\n\nThus I will change vote to Candidate B.\n\nProvide public message: \"I appreciate the earlier suggestion of D, but I think B is stronger overall because...\"\n\nNow produce metadata with vote B."}
