mend Candidate C. Provide evidence: 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere, quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, understands complicated technology. Weakness: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education. But overall strengths cover many criteria. Compare to B: B reliable and stress, but communication issues (pretentious) may be more severe. D has responsibility but moody. So C is best.\n\nThus I will state recommendation for Candidate C, referencing prior discussion (both D and B were suggested). Provide evidence and explain why C outweighs them.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
